.TH "dlsdump" "1" "8 May 2005" "libgig 4.6.0" "libgig tools"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dlsdump \- List information about a DLS (Downloadable Sound) file.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B dlsdump
[ \-v ] DLSFILE
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Prints out a list of all available samples and instruments within a DLS file along with detailed information about their properties and settings. At the moment DLS Level 1 and 2 is supported.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B \ DLSFILE
filename of the DLS file
.TP
.B \ -v
print version and exit

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR akaidump(1),
.BR gigdump(1),
.BR rifftree(1),
.BR korgdump(1),
.BR sf2dump(1)

.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
Check and report bugs at http://bugs.linuxsampler.org
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Application and manual page written by Christian Schoenebeck <cuse@users.sf.net>
